  "description": "The Law of Chicken Shop Convergence. Whether you’re in humanities or sciences, you’ll end up running a chicken shop!\n\n…This law was no exception for the hero who returned after saving the world. However, due to God’s scheme, the hero must now repay a debt together with the Demon King…\n\nDebt? I’ll pay it back… with this chicken!\nBut… something seems off about the employees?\n\nA tear-jerking tale of the hero and Demon King overcoming capitalism\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=805974), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9369292)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002935)",
